STEP 5 -- a user name the far end rejects is reported as a failure        PASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: exactly ONE attempt, with a user name that does not exist (`cknosuchuser`).  A
  wrong password on a real account was deliberately not used.  AW+ locks an account after 5
  failed logins, and every further attempt restarts the timer.  An account that is still
  needed must therefore never pay for a negative test.  No retry loop was run.

    local console prompt: awplus#
    client command: telnet ip 10.38.22.98
    --- before the username prompt ---
